      "Institution records are directory references and do not establish current recognition or approval.",
      "intakeSeats must remain null until the relevant academic-year seat matrix confirms the value.",
      "recognitionStatus must not be interpreted as current approval unless independently verified.",
      "Use the official NMC database for course recognition and approved intake.",
      "Use MCC or the relevant state counselling authority for applicable admission procedures.",
      "Admission to MBBS generally requires NEET-UG qualification and fulfilment of applicable eligibility rules.",
      "Postgraduate admission requirements and counselling routes differ by course and seat category.",
      "Official institution websites must be checked before adding campus addresses, fee structures or contact information."
    ]
  },
